    "Every password Klav generated, for a year": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada contraseña que Klav generó, durante un año"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every sandbox of your proxy issued so far gets no access from its next call: the conversations working in them stop. Nothing asks for Touch ID, and there is no undo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Todos los sandboxes de tu proxy emitidos hasta ahora se quedan sin acceso desde su siguiente llamada: las conversaciones que trabajan en ellos se detienen. No se pide Touch ID y no se puede deshacer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every time": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada vez"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every use by an agent and every decision of yours": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada uso de un agente y cada decisión tuya"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every use of an item by an agent, and every decision of yours, is written in the account’s audit log. The server can’t change an event without this Mac noticing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada uso de un elemento por un agente, y cada decisión tuya, queda en la bitácora de la cuenta. El servidor no puede cambiar un evento sin que este Mac lo note."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every use of an item by an agent, and every decision of yours, is written in the account’s audit log. The server can’t change an event without this iPhone noticing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
