            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dejar que «%@» haga más"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets in the Klav extension you load unpacked in Ardia, Dia, Chrome and other Chromium browsers. Any unpacked extension with the public key in Klav’s repository could talk to klavd too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
