    "On %@, everything in %@ was deleted from the server. This Mac still keeps an encrypted copy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El %1$@ se borró del servidor todo lo de %2$@. Este Mac todavía guarda una copia cifrada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once it’s on, approvals and Activity name the MCP tool of each call. Klav apps, CLIs and klav-proxy older than the gateway can’t read that: their requests list fails and log verification reports tampering, and an older proxy stops serving until it’s updated.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una vez activado, las aprobaciones y Actividad nombran la herramienta MCP de cada llamada. Las apps, CLIs y klav-proxy anteriores al gateway no saben leerlo: su lista de solicitudes falla, la verificación del registro reporta manipulación y un proxy antiguo deja de funcionar hasta que lo actualices."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One confirmation covers what it reads until Klav locks.": {
      "localizations": {
