    "Revoked %lld sandboxes on the server: they get no access from now on. Each says “Revoking…” until the proxy confirms it stopped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se revocaron %lld sandboxes en el servidor: desde ya no tienen acceso. Cada uno dice «Revocando…» hasta que el proxy confirme que se detuvo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Revoked %lld sandboxes on this Mac: they get nothing from the proxy from now on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se revocaron %lld sandboxes en este Mac: desde ya el proxy no les da nada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Revoked %lld sandboxes on this Mac: they get nothing from the proxy from now on. The proxy tells the Klav server as soon as it can.": {
