    "Revoked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Revocado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Revoked. %lld items shared with it one by one are out of Klav’s reach, so their keys didn’t change (their vault is gone, or this Mac no longer sees them). If one comes back, Klav changes its key then; an item deleted for good never comes back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Revoked. %lld item shared with it one by one is out of Klav’s reach, so its key didn’t change (its vault is gone, or this Mac no longer sees it). If it comes back, Klav changes its key then; an item deleted for good never comes back."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Revoked. %lld items shared with it one by one are out of Klav’s reach, so their keys didn’t change (their vault is gone, or this Mac no longer sees them). If one comes back, Klav changes its key then; an item deleted for good never comes back."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Revocado. %lld elemento que le compartiste uno por uno quedó fuera del alcance de Klav, así que su llave no cambió (su bóveda ya no está o este Mac ya no lo ve). Si vuelve a aparecer, Klav le cambia la llave en ese momento; uno borrado para siempre ya no vuelve."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Revocado. %lld elementos que le compartiste uno por uno quedaron fuera del alcance de Klav, así que sus llaves no cambiaron (su bóveda ya no está o este Mac ya no los ve). Si alguno vuelve a aparecer, Klav le cambia la llave en ese momento; uno borrado para siempre ya no vuelve."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Revoked. %lld items shared with it one by one are out of Klav’s reach, so their keys didn’t change (their vault is gone, or this iPhone no longer sees them). If one comes back, Klav changes its key the next time you unlock, or when you tap Finish; an item deleted for good never comes back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Revoked. %lld item shared with it one by one is out of Klav’s reach, so its key didn’t change (its vault is gone, or this iPhone no longer sees it). If it comes back, Klav changes its key the next time you unlock, or when you tap Finish; an item deleted for good never comes back."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Revoked. %lld items shared with it one by one are out of Klav’s reach, so their keys didn’t change (their vault is gone, or this iPhone no longer sees them). If one comes back, Klav changes its key the next time you unlock, or when you tap Finish; an item deleted for good never comes back."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Revocado. %lld elemento que le compartiste uno por uno quedó fuera del alcance de Klav, así que su llave no cambió (su bóveda ya no está o este iPhone ya no lo ve). Si vuelve a aparecer, Klav le cambia la llave la próxima vez que desbloquees, o al tocar «Terminar»; uno borrado para siempre ya no vuelve."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Revocado. %lld elementos que le compartiste uno por uno quedaron fuera del alcance de Klav, así que sus llaves no cambiaron (su bóveda ya no está o este iPhone ya no los ve). Si alguno vuelve a aparecer, Klav le cambia la llave la próxima vez que desbloquees, o al tocar «Terminar»; uno borrado para siempre ya no vuelve."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Revoked. %lld keys are out of Klav’s reach, so they didn’t change (their vault or project is gone, or this iPhone no longer sees them).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Revoked. %lld key is out of Klav’s reach, so it didn’t change (its vault or project is gone, or this iPhone no longer sees it)."
